From b03b1da477b5d0e16fb660aa9560c7ac8be327b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: W1nkelm4nn <mrmarkap61@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 15:01:23 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Keep SPIR-V to MSL conversions in a file across runs.

With MVK_CONFIG_SHADER_CACHE_DIR naming a directory, each conversion is
appended to a file there, keyed by the SPIR-V code and the serialized
conversion configuration a pipeline requests, and later runs take the
MSL from the file instead of converting again. Games that build
thousands of pipelines while loading spent about half of that time in
SPIRV-Cross. The file is specific to the build of MoltenVK and the
device; files of other builds are removed.
---
 MoltenVK/MoltenVK/GPUObjects/MVKPipeline.mm   | 239 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../MoltenVK/GPUObjects/MVKShaderModule.h     |  58 +++++
 .../MoltenVK/GPUObjects/MVKShaderModule.mm    |  19 ++
 3 files changed, 316 insertions(+)

